{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"\"I don't think Web would attack us for revenge. They have many friends here. If Web leaves though. Our town will fracture. Risk versus risk, no rewards. We would lose Skitter, Baeshra, and probably Wren.\"","created_at":"2020-08-11T16:53:19.871000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742787749756665887","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"\"if Web leaves... Web wont have to attack us... for us to be blighted.... have you see Webs place?  It has a blight on it..... For now I will treat this conversation as hypothetical.... and if you can get 2 of the 5 to vote with you to remove that law.... then it will no longer be a law I have to enforce.... But if Web leaves.... or if Web stays and makes undead.... the punishment is both hands and tongue.... to remove the ability to cast ever again..... I will not vote to remove that law.... Web would Likely vote with you.... so you just one of the two remaining to agree.\"  Gil says this with great sadness in his voice.  \"Service is never fair my friend..... and my service to to the law and the lives of our community\"","created_at":"2020-08-11T16:58:11.041000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742788971012161568","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
