{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"“We can survive curses and civil wars. But the Hunger...?”","created_at":"2020-08-11T17:27:47.774000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742796423170621521","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"\"Casualties there will be. I have accepted my death on that day, and I think everyone should. We will look out, knowing that not all of us will survive.\"","created_at":"2020-08-11T17:29:11.677000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-11T17:29:27.154000Z","id":"742796775085179020","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"\"Anyone not willing to die then, should not be there.\"","created_at":"2020-08-11T17:31:06.256000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742797255664336916","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"“I won’t accept it. I won’t accept anyone’s death. I can’t go into this fight expecting my friends to die.” They look determined. “I’m going to figure something out.”","created_at":"2020-08-11T17:33:17.911000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742797807865298985","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"He looks at Wynne sadly. \"The rebound will be so much worse Wynne. Accept the probable. We can't stop everything. Do not blame yourself for anything that happens on that day. It leads down a dark path.\" He gestures to his left arm","created_at":"2020-08-11T17:35:31.723000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742798369113636865","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"They shake their head. “You don’t get it. I can’t fight, expecting others to die. I only fight to protect. As many people as I can. I’m not like you.”","created_at":"2020-08-11T17:38:26.924000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742799103960023070","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
